---
---

<section class="newsletter" aria-label="メールマガジン登録">
  <div class="newsletter-inner">
    <p class="newsletter-eyebrow">NEWSLETTER</p>
    <h2 class="newsletter-title">戦略の知恵を、週に一度。</h2>
    <p class="newsletter-desc">
      新着記事・武将の名言・ビジネス応用コラムをまとめてお届けします。
    </p>

    <form
      class="nl-form"
      action="https://ketsudankeifu.substack.com/subscribe"
      method="GET"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
    >
      <div class="nl-row">
        <input
          class="nl-input"
          type="email"
          name="email"
          placeholder="メールアドレスを入力"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
        />
        <button class="nl-btn" type="submit">無料で購読する</button>
      </div>
      <p class="nl-note">Substackで配信。いつでも解除できます。</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .newsletter {
    background: var(--bg-navy);
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: var(--sp-lg) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }
  .newsletter::before {
    content: "策";
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 18rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: rgba(185, 28, 28, 0.05);
    position: absolute;
    right: -1rem;
    bottom: -2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .newsletter-inner {
    padding: var(--sp-lg);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  .newsletter-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--amber, #d4a017);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .newsletter-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .newsletter-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .nl-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .nl-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .nl-input {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .nl-input::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
  }
  .nl-input:focus {
    border-color: var(--amber, #d4a017);
  }
  .nl-btn {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.2rem;
    background: var(--amber, #d4a017);
    color: #0d0f14;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .nl-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .nl-note {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .nl-row {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .nl-btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
